{"resourceIdentifier":"3241","resourceName":"Guangdong Huidong Afforestation Project","description":"Guangdong Huidong Afforestation Project  is located in Huidong County, Huizhou City, Guangdong Province, in the southeast of Guangdong Province and the east of Huizhou City. The project’s aim is to increase carbon sequestration and contribute to local sustainable development by planting trees on suitable lands  for forestation, and there has never been any activity affecting the local ecosystem. \r\nAn area of 7,950.86  ha, which belongs to the villagers and the village committees manage the lands on behalf of villagers, have been planted on more than 600 parcels of lands since 2015. All the trees planted in the project zone are native species, including Schima superba, Castanopsis fissa, Elaeocarpus sylvestris, Liquidamba formosana, Camphor tree, Cinnamoummum bumannii, Michelia macclurei, Acacia rachii, Castanopsis hystrix, Casuarina equisetifolia Forst., Pinus elliotti, China fir. No invasive alien species or genetically modified organisms are involved.\r\nThe implementation of the project would generate GHG emission removals and improve local environment by planting trees, enhance biodiversity conservation and climate change adaptation, improve soil and water conservation in project zone, strengthening the live skills of local communities and residents by providing their relevant technical skills, training and create more permanent job opportunities for local women and increase income for local communities.","location":{"latitude":22.567148,"longitude":114.610042},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-10-11","endExclusive":"2022-11-11","endInclusive":"2022-11-10"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3241"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"